# Packages/binaries for the kernel-embedded initramfs only.
# Keep this staging root separate from the full Gentoo root to avoid copying
# Bash/GNU/lf and their dependency closure into the kernel image.
#
# sys-apps/msr-tools provides wrmsr. Check whether it can be built static;
# otherwise include and audit its exact shared-library dependency closure.
# The early MSR hook must not guess register numbers or values.
sys-apps/busybox
sys-apps/msr-tools

# Use config/busybox/d630-static.config for this early userspace.
# The dynamic profile is linked against libc and is not suitable for a
# standalone early initramfs shell.
#
# Applets used by initramfs/init:
# ash/sh, cat, chmod, cp, echo, find (-type), mkdir, mount (flags + loop),
# switch_root, umount, wc. printf, read, test and arithmetic are shell built-ins.
# Do not add blkid, grep, sleep or tr unless the init script starts using them.
# The host filesystem used to store the ISO and gentoo-data.img must have
# built-in kernel support; OverlayFS upper/work live on ext4 inside the image.
